# VitePress & TypeDoc generated
lsde-ts/docs/api-ref/
# Derived from api-ref above, so it carries TypeDoc's commit SHA in every source link: tracking
# it produced a 309-line diff on every commit that said nothing. `npm run docs` regenerates it
# before the site is built. The four llm-full-guide-*.txt next to it come from tracked prose and
# stay tracked.
lsde-ts/docs/public/llm-full-api.txt
lsde-ts/docs/.vitepress/dist
lsde-ts/docs/.vitepress/cache

# Publish artifacts
# What 2-build-release packs and 3-publish sends (scripts/release/).
/release/
*.nupkg
*.tgz
.npmrc
lsde-ts/scripts/README.md

